<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Verify your email</title></head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; color: #111;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Hi {{name}},</h1>
  <p>Welcome to FormNest! Please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #4F46E5; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px;">Verify Email</a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Or copy this link into your browser:<br><span style="word-break: break-all;">{{verifyUrl}}</span></p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This link expires in 24 hours.</p>
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 32px 0;">
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">If you didn't sign up for FormNest, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
